        "clearance": "Section II // Clearance OMEGA",
        "bioTag": "PRE-EVENT CANON DOSSIER",
        "bioSummary": "Condensed archival dossier summarizing early origins, frontline captivity, and tactical service transition.",
        "bio": "Orphaned at a young age alongside her younger sister **Penelope** following a tragic vehicular collision, Vivient Lock was raised by Michael and Sara Carter—a decorated veteran and an esteemed alchemical chemist. Imbued with Michael’s unwavering discipline and driven by a fierce desire to protect her sister, Vivient enlisted at age 23 as a tactical reconnaissance operative in the disputed borderlands of Sohm Province.\n\nWhen her reconnaissance squad was ambushed and captured deep behind enemy lines, Vivient endured weeks of brutal interrogation and solitary captivity, sustained purely by an unyielding vow to return home alive to Penelope. After being rescued by allied forces, she received an honorable medical discharge and the **NUS Medal of Valor**—becoming the youngest recipient in nation history—before channelling her trauma and protective instincts into civic defense at the Police Academy, where she graduated **Valedictorian**.\n\nRenowned for neutralizing high-stakes threats without bystander casualties, Vivient now serves as an elite **Tier-1 tactical operative** with the Federal Bureau of Control Magic (FBCM). While her sister Penelope explores volatile esoteric syntheses, Vivient remains grounded in physical defense and unwavering personal accountability—standing as an impenetrable shield for those caught in the crossfire of fractured nations.",
        "kinshipTag": "ARCHIVAL RECORD // VERIFIED",
        "kinshipSummary": "Authenticated lineage registry, guardian household dynamics, and core psychological temperament analysis.",
