          {
            "name": "Anthony & Samantha Lock",
            "relation": "Biological • Deceased",
            "accent": "tertiary",
            "description": "Father Anthony was a transit machinist known for mechanical tenacity; Mother Samantha was an etheric weaver of radiant warmth. Their tragic vehicular loss left an indelible mark of protective resolve on young Vivient.",
