        "personality": [
          {
            "title": "Core Persona & Demeanor",
            "tag": "Tough • Authentic • Humane",
            "description": "Tough, courageous, and exceptionally capable under fire, yet deeply human and emotionally grounded. Unlike an unfeeling corporate weapon or flawless supermodel, Vivient is genuine—someone who laughs with squadmates, bears visible battle scars, confronts survivor guilt with unflinching honesty, and refuses to let bureaucracy treat human lives as expendable.",
